<title>USA: FSA quaifies six muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA quaifies six muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance on Monday said that it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal bond issues, which will be sold competitively today.</p>
<p>--Western Springs, Ill., $1.9 milliongeneral obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Traverse Area Pub, Mich., $15 million school building bonds.</p>
<p>--Cook County ISD, Minn., $995,000 GOs.</p>
<p>--North Richland Hills, Texas, $4.1 million limited tax GOs bonds.</p>
<p>--North Richland Hills, Texas, $2.755 million certificate of participation revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Oostburg School District, Wis., $4.25 million school building GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
